{"2835570":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Buckshot Roulette","steam_appid":2835570,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2835570\/extras\/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.poster.avif?t=1783085442\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2835570\/extras\/4ae7c9c589299cc7c888daaa1e55fe2a.mp4?t=1783085442\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>게임 친구들을 쏴버리십시오<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >새롭게 마련된 4인용 멀티플레이어 테이블에 앉아보시지요. 협상하십시오. 구걸하십시오. 배신하십시오. 최후의 승자가 되십시오. 부를 거머쥐고 떠나버리십시오.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2835570\/extras\/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.poster.avif?t=1783085442\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2835570\/extras\/c56a26ad4b01b821c093ceef17162778.mp4?t=1783085442\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >12게이지 액션<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 12게이지 샷건으로 러시안 룰렛을 플레이하세요. 왜냐면 샷건이 더 멋지니까요.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2835570\/extras\/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.poster.avif?t=1783085442\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2835570\/extras\/8ef4f9481329a91f17a298df1e202a29.mp4?t=1783085442\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=